### CREATE TRAFFIC RECORD
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traffic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "densityLevel": "HIGH",
  "vehicleCount": 150
}

###

### CREATE LOW TRAFFIC
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traffic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "densityLevel": "LOW",
  "vehicleCount": 40
}

###

### CREATE MEDIUM TRAFFIC
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traffic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "densityLevel": "MEDIUM",
  "vehicleCount": 90
}

###

### CREATE VERY HIGH TRAFFIC
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traffic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "densityLevel": "VERY_HIGH",
  "vehicleCount": 250
}

###

### GET ALL TRAFFIC RECORDS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traffic

###

### GET TRAFFIC BY ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traffic/1

###

### UPDATE TRAFFIC RECORD
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/traffic/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "densityLevel": "MEDIUM",
  "vehicleCount": 100
}

###

### DELETE TRAFFIC RECORD
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/traffic/1